      "names_in_binary": ["minimal", "low", "medium", "high", "xhigh", "max", "ultra"],
      "note": "names_in_binary is one string list read from the binary. Only low and high are confirmed in use: TODO(verify) any other level before an alias uses it (until then ck-run passes no effort flag for it)."
